{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620350/extras/library.gif?t=1744314578\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this story-rich point-and-click adventure, you play as Tobias, a young commoner from a fishing village. After finding a mysterious crystal, his brother suddenly falls  ill, and Tobias is forced into a knowledge-seeking journey to save him. But he is not prepared for what he is about to discover...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620350/extras/separate_line_.png?t=1744314578\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic point-and-click adventure gameplay: puzzles, dialogue, and clever item usage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Focus on story and immersion, with logical character actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Around 5\u201310 hours of dark storytelling with unexpected twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gorgeous, hand-animated pixel art graphics and an original soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cast of unique characters with full voice acting, plus a cat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620350/extras/cave_scene.gif?t=1744314578\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620350?t=1744314578","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620350/88698d65f6ccddeaeb75b8a786d632308168184c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744314578","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620350/4b6c211ff011fcf6f63a7d3d6bd08f821557fd77/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744314578","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620350/4b6c211